## 0. The concept — what CopyCat is

A premium, production-ready web app called **CopyCat** (TEMPORARY working name — it will change later, so put the name in ONE config constant, `APP_NAME`, and use it everywhere; never hard-code the name in 20 places. It is taken: a Shopify "Copy Cat" app, copycatpro.io, and a registered USPTO COPYCAT trademark for video software. Do not do a name clearance in this build — just keep the name in one constant so it is trivial to swap.)

CopyCat is for people doing **organic AI dropshipping on TikTok** — AI-generated TikTok videos, no ad spend, no TikTok Shop.

The product is two jobs, nothing else:

1. **See what went viral in the last 24 hours** — a feed of viral organic TikTok videos from the last day.
2. **Recreate it** — two ways, the user's choice: **(a)** through CopyCat's own video generation (pick a video → tailored concepts → generate, up to 30 seconds, 9:16, native audio), or **(b)** with the tools to generate it themselves on Claude — a ready-to-paste Claude prompt (viral format + their product/character → concept, hook, 5 shots, caption, and a video generation prompt) they copy from the video card.

It is 50% intelligence dashboard + 50% video generation, in one app. Everything else is supporting, not the product.

What it is NOT: not TikTok Shop, not a paid-ad spy tool, not a product-sourcing tool (that feature was removed — most users do NOT have a product ready yet, it is custom-made), not a generic AI video generator.

Competitor bundle it replaces: Minea ($49/mo) + Higgsfield Plus ($59/mo) = $108/mo. CopyCat Starter is $49/mo for both halves together. You save $59/mo. Say that plainly on the landing page and the pricing page, with the real Minea and Higgsfield logos beside their names (see Section 8).

