- **Compare:** tick two videos and a "Compare" button appears. Side by side: views, velocity, comments, posting time, CTA keyword. The user is deciding which format to copy — comparison is the decision tool.
- **Saved filters:** a "Save this filter" button next to the search. Saved filters appear as chips under the search box ("LED wings · 6h", "Toys · 24h"). The user runs the same searches every day — don't make them rebuild the filter each time.
